OL,3,GNEWSAZoo's 'much-loved' tortoise dies
OL,4,
OL,5,FA giant tortoise, who was more than 100
OL,6,Fyears old, and a "much-loved resident"
OL,7,Fat a zoo, has died.
OL,9,FJersey Zoo said Biggy, the Aldabra
OL,10,Fgiant tortoise, was taken to the Royal
OL,11,FVeterinary College for specialist CT
OL,12,Fscans for a reoccurring health issue.
OL,14,FThe zoo said despite efforts from its
OL,15,Fveterinary team the growth around his
OL,16,Fbackside returned after two previous
OL,17,Fsurgeries.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
