OL,3,GNEWSAZoo's 'much-loved' tortoise dies
OL,4,
OL,5,FIt said any further operations would
OL,6,Fhave risked causing permanent damage to
OL,7,Fthe tortoise, and after consideration
OL,8,Fstaff "made the heartbreaking decision
OL,9,Fto put Biggy to sleep to prevent
OL,10,Ffurther pain".
